$(N-1,\ 2N-1)$ & $1$\\
$(N-1,\ 2N+1)$ & $3$\\
$(N+1,\ N^2+1)$ & $2$\\
$(N+1,\ N^2+N+1)$ & $1$\\
$(N+1,\ 2N-1)$ & $3$\\
